		"en": [
			"If you step it up a notch, it will shine!",
			"Easily upgrade your display!",
			"A collection stage compatible with a wide range of plastic model series is now available!!",
			"• Smoke black clear reminiscent of outer space.",
			"• Can be connected vertically and horizontally using the included joint parts.",
			"• Compact size of approximately 255mm x 172mm, suitable for display. It is also possible to turn a corner of your desktop into a collection booth.",
